{"id":"n19266-1-8","stage":5,"title":"공상 · 空想","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n19266-1-8-1","ko":"피곤해 보이네.","zh":"你看起来好累啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"피곤해","meaning":"疲倦，疲惫，困","explanation":"피곤하다：疲倦，疲惫，困；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"피곤하다","audio":"/audio/69e26389ae2a6e2f50d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60291","senseId":"1","lemma":"피곤하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보이네.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"69e26389ae2a6e2f","term":"피곤하다","zh":"疲倦，疲惫，困","audio":"/audio/69e26389ae2a6e2f50d8.mp3","entryId":"60291","definition":"身体或心里觉得累而筋疲力尽。","pronunciation":["피곤하다"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/77a9fe559d2dee271a55.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n19266-1-8-2","ko":"응, 이런 저런 공상을 하느라 밤을 새우고 말았어.","zh":"嗯，因为一直在胡思乱想，结果熬了一整夜呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이런","meaning":"这样的","explanation":"이런：这样的","readings":[{"term":"이런","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17869","senseId":"1","lemma":"이런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저런","meaning":"那样的","explanation":"저런：那样的","readings":[{"term":"저런","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71222","senseId":"1","lemma":"저런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공상을","meaning":"空想","explanation":"공상：空想；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공상","audio":"/audio/3f2273bd9fd79be49ffe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19266","senseId":"1","lemma":"공상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하느라","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；느라：说明因忙于前一动作而出现后续情况，常接不利结果。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밤을","meaning":"夜，夜间","explanation":"밤：夜，夜间；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"밤","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74178","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새우고","meaning":"熬夜","explanation":"새우다：熬夜；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"새우다","audio":"/audio/efedf2571351c3f61787.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16235","senseId":"1","lemma":"새우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말았어.","meaning":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）","explanation":"말다：结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72580","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"82a16d424583893e","term":"이런","zh":"这样的","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3","entryId":"17869","definition":"状态、样子、性质等这样的。","pronunciation":["이런"]},{"id":"2f66dcda6095507e","term":"저런","zh":"那样的","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3","entryId":"71222","definition":"状态、样子、性格等那种的。","pronunciation":["저런"]},{"id":"3f2273bd9fd79be4","term":"공상","zh":"空想","audio":"/audio/3f2273bd9fd79be49ffe.mp3","entryId":"19266","definition":"脑子里想着实际不存在或不可能实现的事情；或那种想法。","pronunciation":["공상"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"da9e530428ce1c2d","term":"밤","zh":"夜，夜间","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3","entryId":"74178","definition":"日落到第二天日出前的黑暗时段。","pronunciation":["밤"]},{"id":"efedf2571351c3f6","term":"새우다","zh":"熬夜","audio":"/audio/efedf2571351c3f61787.mp3","entryId":"16235","definition":"不睡觉而度过一夜。","pronunciation":["새우다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"72580","definition":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d9c5cf78fec5e535d291.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.44,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=19266","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":164,"sequenceScore":3.2667,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，因为一直在胡思乱想，结果熬了一整夜呢。","你听懂我说的话了吗？","你看起来好累啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯，因为一直在胡思乱想，结果熬了一整夜呢。","你看起来好累啊。","你听懂我说的话了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
